      "title": "Mayberry Laboratory for Multimodal Language Development",
      "headings": [
        "Welcome to the Lab"
      ],
      "text": "Welcome to the Lab Welcome to the Mayberry Laboratory for Multimodal Language Development. We investigate language acquisition and processing across the multiple sensory and motor modalities through which language occurs: sign language, spoken language, written language, and gesture. We use a variety of psycholinguistic and neurolinguistic paradigms to discover how the child's early language experience affects adult language ability across these modalities.",
